l; like how Toad now can wear pelts made of the critter he's eaten. Here's me hangin with my porcupine wearing the head of the fly I ate- I'll also be trying out our new planet-sized boss, Diamond Dev! Diamond Dev is a robotic Tasmanian devil that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:42:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038569","verified_at":"2026-10-24T04:20:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3173780-1846651706681528","game_id":"steam-3173780","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo Now and Steam Next Fest Soon!","summary":"Well hello Toadies!We haven't made an update since our big expo at GDC in March. Since then, we've added a bunch of new features and polish to Toadled!For example, our MOST requested feature... A Volume Slider!I kid you not, one out of every 2-3 testers would look for a volume slider when they first started the game. It was always a low priority for us, since we like the music at the default levels, but we bumped it up since we heard from so many players about it. Thanks for letting us know what","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:41:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681528","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3173780-1828441623111834","game_id":"steam-3173780","kind":"announcement","title":"Toadled: Eating Frenzy at GDC 2026","summary":"Tasty showcasesGreetings, Toadlers! 🐸We’re hopping in to give a fly-by recap of our time at GDC, and what a time it was! Toadled: Eating Frenzy was featured in a whopping FOUR showcases - CourageXL, PocketGamer's Big Indie Zone, Unity's Indie Arcade, and even right in GDC Expo Hall!Friends of the toadWe got to show off Toadled: Eating Frenzy next to our other title, Swing Striker; a physics-based soccer battler. No toads or frogs in that one yet, but we’re sure an amphibious alien of some kind w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-31T10:39:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623111834","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3173780-1813041031205447","game_id":"steam-3173780","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcement Trailer","summary":"Hi gamers! 👾 Today we are most proud to present a brand new announcement trailer for Toadled: Eating Frenzy! Sit back and learn all about this dark comedy action roguelike with an appetite. Without further ado: If you enjoyed the mayhem that Toadled: Eating Frenzy has to offer then you might be happy to learn that really soon you will be able to access an exclusive closed Steam playtest by signing up for a G.Round playtesting platform account. Impatient to hop into action? Follow our delicious s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-09T11:39:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031205447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3173780-1803527891861440","game_id":"steam-3173780","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Gameplay - Part 2","summary":"What's up, toads, toadettes, and enby frenzies? 🐸 This is again Janek the community toad. Here is the promised second part of the official developer gameplay video for Toadled: Eating Frenzy. Enjoy! Nikko the gameplay specialist will continue his playthrough and tell you a bit more about the very cool facets of Toadled: Eating Frenzy such as ability builds and other crucial and toadally awesome quirks. 🤪 If you are new here then please be informed that there is also part one of the gameplay avai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-07T11:18:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891861440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3173780-1799088287859064","game_id":"steam-3173780","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Gameplay - Part 1","summary":"Hello, fellow tongue catchers! 👅 This is the community toad Janek speaking. Today I have a real tasty treat for you: the very first official developer gameplay video for Toadled: Eating Frenzy! Join our gameplay specialist Nikko as they explain the ins and outs of all the new additions to Toadled: Eating Frenzy compared with the legacy Classic version. 💯 And if your curiosity is still unquenched after that one? There is a part two coming real soon! Of course feel free to drop any questions in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-09T08:32:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287859064","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3173780-1794102528268560","game_id":"steam-3173780","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1 - Items Galore","summary":"Greetings, Toadlers! 💚 Game designer Josh here. I’d like to tell you about one of the biggest and most exciting changes we’ve introduced to Toadled: Eating Frenzy over the past year: items. Items improve various parts of your game. You get to choose or upgrade one item halfway through each level, and then again when you beat the level. Items come in four categories: Buddies 🦔 These helpful animal friends periodically wake up to launch an attack. Some, like Buzz the turtle, just do a lot of damag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"20